flowchart TD
  A[Initialize task history, reader picks and repeat guards] --> B{Stopped or step limit reached?}
  B -- Yes --> END[Return report; no further actions]
  B -- No --> O[Observe permitted state, or reuse a saved snapshot]
  O --> F[Filter in Rust; build compact planner input]
  F --> P[Planner model proposes ONE JSON action]
  P --> V{Valid action and current target?}
  V -- No --> R{Correction already used this step?}
  R -- No --> P
  R -- Yes --> END
  V -- Yes --> K{Action kind?}
  K -- Read --> READ[Reader path: see data diagram]
  READ -- Element result --> L[Log outcome; update bounded history]
  READ -- Owner excerpts / terminal failure --> END
  K -- Give up / unsupported answer --> END
  K -- Phone operation --> G{Capability and app grant permit it?}
  G -- No --> END
  G -- Yes --> C{Guarded operation needs approval?}
  C -- Yes --> AP{Owner approves exact operation?}
  AP -- No --> END
  AP -- Yes --> X[Recheck cancellation / authorization; dispatch via host]
  C -- No --> X
  X --> HOST[Android host rechecks live app rule; asks if Always approval]
  HOST --> Q{Execution outcome?}
  Q -- Unknown --> END
  Q -- Acknowledged / not executed --> L
  L --> B
  K -- Done claim --> OBS[Observe fresh state]
  OBS --> VER[Launch postcondition in code; otherwise verifier model]
  VER --> OK{Completion supported by evidence?}
  OK -- Yes --> DONE[Return verified completion]
  OK -- No: general task --> L
  OK -- No: launch-only task --> END
